

Now, we need to produce the plan. Let's list the actions we need to execute in order.

We need to start with initial state.

We need to attach route_task_profile_alpha to origin_availability_alpha (attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, and route_task_profile_available becomes false.

Then we need to confirm candidate_preparedness for origin_availability_alpha (confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha.

Then we need to load origin payload (load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha). This will set origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, cargo_available false.

Then we need to unload origin payload (unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha). This will set origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available true, origin_payload_linked removed.

Now we have origin_node_occupied true, origin_node_ready true, origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true.

Now we need to detach origin_availability_alpha from route_task_profile_alpha (detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set route_task_profile_available true, and remove candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Now route_task_profile_available true again.

Now we need to attach route_task_profile_alpha to destination_availability_alpha (attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, route_task_profile_available false.

Now we need to confirm candidate_preparedness for destination_availability_alpha (confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set candidate_prepared destination_availability_alpha.

Now we need to load destination payload (load_destination_payload destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha). This will set destination_node_occupied, destination_availability_locked, destination_payload_linked, cargo_available false.

Now we need to unload destination payload (unload_destination_payload destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha). This will set destination_node_ready, destination_availability_confirmed, cargo_available true, destination_payload_linked removed.

Now we have destination_node_occupied true, destination_node_ready true, destination_availability_locked true, destination_availability_confirmed true.

Now we need to detach destination_availability_alpha (detach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set route_task_profile_available true, remove candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Now route_task_profile_available true again.

Now we need to attach route_task_profile_alpha to shift_candidate_alpha (attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, route_task_profile_available false.

Now we need to stage shift_candidate_alpha (stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This requires candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha (true), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha (true), loading_container_loaded loading_container_alpha (false), loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha (false), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), not origin_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (true initially), not candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_alpha (true). So we need to load container onto leg first.

Thus, we need to assemble transport leg (origin_loaded_leg) before loading container.

Thus, we need to assemble origin_loaded_leg (assemble_origin_loaded_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha). This requires origin_availability_locked (true), destination_availability_locked (true), origin_availability_node_linked (true), destination_availability_node_linked (true), origin_node_occupied (true), destination_node_ready (true), not origin_availability_confirmed (false), destination_availability_confirmed (true), transport_leg_available (true). So we can assemble origin_loaded_leg.

Effect: transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_origin_linked true, transport_leg_destination_linked true, origin_leg_loaded true, transport_leg_available false.

Now we have transport_leg_assembled true, origin_leg_loaded true.

Now we need to re-attach origin_availability_alpha to route_task_profile_alpha (attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This will set candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, route_task_profile_available false.

Now we need to authorize transport leg loading (authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). This requires transport_leg_assembled true, origin_availability_locked true, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true, not transport_leg_loading_authorized true. So we can authorize loading.

Effect: transport_leg_loading_authorized true.

